r exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Profile</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">A public summary of a team member, with their role, background and activity.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items: center;\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width: 72px; height: 72px; font-size: 1.5rem;\">AK</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items: center;\">\n            <h2>Amara Okonkwo</h2>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Available</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Senior Product Designer, Platform Team</p>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Design Systems</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Accessibility</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        Designs complex workflows for developer tools. Currently leading the component library\n        rewrite and mentoring two junior designers. Based in Lagos, working across London hours.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Followers</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"follower-count\">1,284</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Projects</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">27</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Endorsements</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">96</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr>\n\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items: center;\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"follow-status\">You are not following Amara.</p>\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"follow-btn\" type=\"button\">Follow</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var btn = document.getElementById('follow-btn');\n  var status = document.getElementById('follow-status');\n  var count = document.getElementById('follower-count');\n  var following = false;\n  var base = 1284;\n\n  btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    following = !following;\n    btn.textContent = following ? 'Following' : 'Follow';\n    btn.className = following ? 'btn btn-outline' : 'btn';\n    status.textContent = following\n      ? 'You are following Amara. Updates will appear in your feed.'\n      : 'You are not following Amara.';\n    count.textContent = (base + (following ? 1 : 0)).toLocaleString();\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[3768,"<div class=\"page"],[3768,"\">"],[3768,"\n  <div class=\"stack"],[3768," g"],[3768,"ap-l"],[3768,"g\">\n    <div"],[3768,">"],[3768,"\n      <h1>Prof"],[3768,"ile</h1>\n      <"],[3768,"p class=\"lead\">A public"],[3768," summary of a"],[3768," team member, with their"],[3768," role"],[3774,","],[3774," background"],[3774," and activ"],[3774,"ity.</p>\n    </"],[3774,"div>\n\n    <div class=\""],[3774,"card st"],[3774,"ack gap-l"],[3774,"g\""],[3774," style=\"max